WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your new show
is about rejecting shame

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
and learning to embrace
who you are.

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:06.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I think it's
a nice alternative

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.108 line:92%
to hating yourself all the time.

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:08.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, it is.
Exactly.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that's great,
because sometimes people

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
just keep their emotions
bottled up inside,

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:14.848
even though it feels so much
better to let it out, you know?

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:15.382 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:18.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, have you ever tried
doing a "hey, world"?

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:20.253 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No, what is that?

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.254 line:92%
-Oh, okay, well, "hey, world"

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:25.759
is when you shout your deepest
confessions and insecurities

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:27.494 line:92%
out to the whole dang world.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.863 size:81% position:41%
You know, just own it.
It feels really great.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hm, interesting.
Can you show me how it works?

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:35.068
-Oh, sure.
So basically, you just look out,

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:35.735 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and you scream something

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:37.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you've kept inside
for a long time.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:40.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, like, I might say,
"Hey, world!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
I once had a full
make-out session with someone

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:45.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
while a YouTube video
of rodeo bloopers

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.213 line:92%
was on in the background."

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:50.083 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah, I feel better.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did that really happen?
-Yeah, baby.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to get in on this.
Let's do this.

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:56.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, world.
Here we go.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:57.757 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.325 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-♪♪ Hey, world ♪♪

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.693 line:92%
♪♪ The world, the world ♪♪

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:02.128 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪ Hey, world ♪♪

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:06.800 line:92%
♪♪ The world, the world ♪♪

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.901 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey, world.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
My first time at the Emmys,
I was so hungry,

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:14.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
I ate a hot dog
in the lobby barefoot.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:15.675 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm gorgeous.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.478 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.380 line:92%
-Hey, world, the other day,

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
I plucked an inch-long hair
from my earlobe.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
An inch-long hair
from my earlobe, world.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:29.923 line:92%
That shouldn't be possible.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.925 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:32.826 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey, world!

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:36.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
I truly think that "diarrhea"
is a beautiful word.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:43.269
And I would not rule out naming
my daughter or son Diarrhea.

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:45.004 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, world, my doctor told me
I have acid reflux

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:51.344
and I shouldn't eat spicy foods
before I go to sleep.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
But the other night I ate
a giant bowl of penne in bed,

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.450
and then I put the bowl
on my end table and fell asleep.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.384 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I loved it!

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.553 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:02.655 line:92%
-Hey, world, when I was 5,

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:06.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did not understand
what hard-boiled eggs were.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought they were
going to hatch,

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:12.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I took some and I put them
in a bush in my backyard.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:16.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
And for days I brought them
water and food.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.037 line:92%
And I would sing to them.

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:22.775
And then I went outside, and
they were covered in maggots,

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.210 line:92%
and I screamed for my dad,

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:28.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I watched as he
shoveled away my children.

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:30.483 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:33.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, world,
ever since I became a dad,

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.855 line:92%
I basically stopped sleeping.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.223 line:92%
I am so tired all the time.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:41.194
The other day, my daughter snuck
into bed with me and my wife,

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.362 line:92%
fell asleep, and peed the bed.

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:45.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so tired that I actually
thought to myself,

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:45.965 line:92%
"If my wife doesn't wake up,

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:49.235
then I'm just going to keep
sleeping in pee-soaked sheets."

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:51.204 line:92%
That's how badly I need sleep.

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:53.373 line:92%
I don't care if I sleep in pee!

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:55.608 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:58.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, world,
it's Aidy and Jimmy.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:02.448
We're going to do this one
together because why not?

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:03.816 line:92%
It feels good to have a friend

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:05.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
you can shout stuff
to the world with.

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:10.056
I'll admit it hurts our voices
a bit, but it's totally worth it

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:12.926
because it's fun and cathartic,
okay?

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's it.
That's everything.

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're done now.
See you later.

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:19.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Bye, world!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:22.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wow!
I feel so much better!

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:24.737 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Aidy Bryant, everyone.

